 ('pyridine','Pyridine','C5H5N','ligand-exchange and specimen solvent','HPLC grade, EM Sciences; XPS shows residual phosphorus even after pyridine exchange.'),
 ('butanol','1-Butanol','C4H10O','storage-fluid additive','HPLC grade, EM Sciences. Prevents TOPO solidification; source does not assign Danek alcoholysis rationale.'),
