intuition=[
 I('intuition_temperature','Select the overgrowth temperature jointly with core size: retain the core distribution while enabling precursor decomposition and crystalline shells. The source map is empirical for this chemistry and cannot be generalized automatically.',3,'III.A and note22','author_intuition'),
 I('intuition_dose','Keep seeded growth favored through dilute, slow precursor addition; measure actual composition/coverage because incomplete conversion and wall losses break the equality between nominal dose and deposited shell.',2,'Synthesis dose discussion','author_intuition'),
 I('intuition_optimum','An inorganic shell passivates surface traps, but more shell is not monotonically better. Source evidence links~1.3ML to maximumPL and suppression ofSeoxidation, while thicker nonuniform/defective shells reduceyield.',12,'IV.B','author_intuition'),
 I('intuition_multimethod','UseTEMlong-axis statistics, WDScomposition, surfaceXPS, scattering fits andoptical spectra together; no one method resolves allgeometry,phase,composition andbatchidentity.',12,'IV.B','author_intuition'),
 I('intuition_shellchoice','ZnS provides stronger carrier confinement thanCdS in the simplifiedmodel;CdSallows moredelocalization andlargerredshift. These observations motivate chemicaldesign butare not a universal efficiency ranking acrossmaterials.',11,'IV.A','author_intuition'),
 I('intuition_ligands','Retain growthsolution to preserve organic caps, and treat purification as a possible stability-changing operation. Pyridineexchange neednotremove everyphosphorusligand; highcoverage ZnS dots mayirreversiblyflocculate.',2,'Storage andp5/p7discussion','author_intuition'),
 I('intuition_future','Mechanistic improvement would distinguish strain-relaxation dislocations from coalescing-shell-island boundaries and improve ligand stabilization. Bothgrowthscenarios remain sourceproposals; no undocumented optimizedrecipe is implied.',12,'Growthmechanisms','author_intuition')]

